2026-03-05 Peter Colarco
Refactor how we do the degassing volcanic eruptions.
Update base database to Catalogue_SO2_2025.xls from:
https://so2.gsfc.nasa.gov/kml/Catalogue_SO2_2025.xls
Use the first tab in spreadsheet (Catalogue) and copy
to last sheet Catalogue_Volcano then sort by TYPE and
remove all but volcanoes and then clean up the format
a bit (restrict lat/lon to XXX.YYY format and put
"_" in names with spaces and save as text delimited
file: so2_passive_degassing_2005-2025_20260305.txt
New rule is to write dates prior to 2005 with 2005
annual data and dates after 2025 with 2025 data.

2026-02-02 Peter Colarco
Updated to most recent database from:
https://so2.gsfc.nasa.gov/eruptions/MSVOLSO2L4_20260129.txt
valid until 20260129
NB: the degassing file we have provided to M21C is based on 2020 degassing fields


